Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,H_ms,,0,0,0,,Si puteri hilang segalanya... kini dia berlutut memohon
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Jangan asyik tekan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Seluruh tingkat 28 milik Shen Xiujin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.38,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tanpa kad awak tak boleh naik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:10.68,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Jian Tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.12,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Puan Jian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.85,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Hari ini awak betul-betul buka mata saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.13,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Dahulu Puan Jian yang sombong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:18.81,S_ms,,0,0,0,,kini demi meminta belas kasihan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.25,S_ms,,0,0,0,,merendah diri di khalayak ramai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.33,S_ms,,0,0,0,,memeluk seorang hamba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.19,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Katakanlah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:26.93,S_ms,,0,0,0,,kalau si tua Jian Zhendong tahu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:29.23,S_ms,,0,0,0,,akan dia malu jadi-jadinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.78,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Keluarga Jian tiada Jian Tong.
